: 700 W.<\/li>  <li>Indicador luminoso de encendido\/listo.<\/li>  <li>Revestimiento y placa antiadherente<\/li>  <li>Recogecable.<\/li>  <li>Cierre de seguridad.<\/li>  <li>Posici\u00f3n de guardado vertical.<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_ari-pae-gofre%201973_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"22.15","unit_price_tax":27.15},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8003705119024"],"reference":"1973","name":{"1":"Gofrera Ariete Party Time\/ 700W","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p>Esta gofrera de nuevo dise\u00f1o retro de los a\u00f1os 50 es r\u00e1pida y f\u00e1cil de usar. En pocos minutos podr\u00e1s preparar unos deliciosos gofres. Solo tienes que preparar la masa y verterla en la cavidad, cerrar la tapa y esperar unos minutos. Decora tus gofres con tu complemento preferido y estar\u00e1n listos para degustar.<br><br><ul>  <li>Potencia: 700 W.<\/li>  <li>Indicador luminoso de encendido\/listo.<\/li>  <li>Revestimiento y placa antiadherente<\/li>  <li>Recogecable.<\/li>  <li>Cierre de seguridad.<\/li>  <li>Posici\u00f3n de guardado vertical.<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ARIETE","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":1.8,"unit_price":27.15,"unit_price_tax":27.15,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cocina","sub_category":"Panificadoras - Palomiteras - Creperas","quantity":2,"brand":"ARIETE","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_ari-pae-gofre%201973_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":22.15}}},"4242005084753":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["4242005084753",false],"wholesale_price":[26.53,false],"price":[31.53,false],"id_tax_rule