de 0.6 mm<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_bic-cristal%20fun%20caja%2020u_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"3.50","unit_price_tax":8.5},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["3086123272101"],"reference":"895793","name":{"1":"Caja de Bol\u00edgrafos de Tinta de Aceite Bic Cristal Fun 895793\/ 20 unidades\/ Colores Surtidos","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <p><ul>  <li>Bol\u00edgrafo de punta gruesa y tinta aceite<\/li>  <li>dise\u00f1ado con un cuerpo transl\u00facido que permite ver el nivel de tinta<\/li>  <li>Tap\u00f3n y capuch\u00f3n del color de la tinta<\/li>  <li>Contiene 4 colores: morado turquesa, rosa y verde lima<\/li>  <li>Tiene una punta con grosor de 1.6 mm y un trazo de 0.6 mm<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"BIC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.12,"unit_price":8.5,"unit_price_tax":8.5,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Escritura","sub_category":"Bol\u00edgrafos","quantity":2,"brand":"BIC","images":["https:\/\