 avisa.<\/li><li>Capacidad de la bolsa de 2,5 L.<\/li><li>AutoCharge: carga autom\u00e1tica de la bater\u00eda<\/li><li>Compatible con las series 8000 y 9000.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Composici\u00f3n<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>Base de autovaciado&nbsp;<\/li><li>3 bolsas higi\u00e9nicas<\/li><li>Manual de instrucciones<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"CECOTEC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":9.1,"unit_price":133.49,"unit_price_tax":133.49,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza de Hogar","sub_category":"Robots Aspirador","quantity":5,"brand":"CECOTEC","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_cec-base%20conga%20home%2010000_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":128.49}}},"8435484056724":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435484056724",false],"wholesale_price":[41.18,false],"price":[46.18,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:95047","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 2","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/cef8e2bf22560cbef43458bb210b5b7a.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Aspirador Escoba Cecotec Conga PopStar 600 Vital\/ 600W","category":"Limpieza de Hogar","sub_category":"Aspiradores","unit_price":46.18,"reference":"05672","ean13":"8435484056724","weight":"0","quantity":0,"brand":"CECOTEC","description_pt":"<h2>Aspirador escoba con cable&nbsp;Conga PopStar 600 Vital<\/h2><p><p><ul><li>Gran poder de succi\u00f3n: hasta 18 kPa.&nbsp;<\/li><li>UltraPower Technology: gran potencia con un consumo reducido de tan solo 600 W.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Cyclonic System: no pierdas poder de succi\u00f3n gracias a los \u00faltimos avances en aspiraci\u00f3n.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Filtro de alta eficiencia: filtrado profesional que retiene gran porcentaje de al\u00e9rgenos.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Tecnolog\u00eda 360\u00ba Twisted: no hay rinc\u00f3n imposible gracias a su cabezal inclinable hasta 360\u00ba.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Cable XXL: llega a donde necesites gracias a sus 6 metros de radio de acci\u00f3n.&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Composici\u00f3n<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>Aspirador vertical&nbsp;<\/li><li>Accesorio para esquinas<\/li><li>Accesorio para muebles<\/li><li>Soporte de pared<\/li><li>Manual de instrucciones<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_cec-pae-asp%20popst%20600%20vit_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"41.18","unit_price_tax":46.18},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8435484056724"],"reference":"05672","name":{"1":"Aspirador Escoba Cecotec Conga PopStar 600 Vital\/ 600W","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<h2>Aspirador escoba con cable&nbsp;Conga PopStar 600 Vital<\/h2><p><p><ul><li>Gran poder de succi\u00f3n: hasta 18 kPa.&nbsp;<\/li><li>UltraPower Technology: gran potencia con un consumo reducido de tan solo 600 W.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Cyclonic System: no pierdas poder de succi\u00f3n gracias a los \u00faltimos avances en aspiraci\u00f3n.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Filtro de alta eficiencia: filtrado profesional que retiene gran porcentaje de al\u00e9rgenos.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Tecnolog\u00eda 360\u00ba Twisted: no hay rinc\u00f3n imposible gracias a su cabezal inclinable hasta 360\u00ba.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Cable XXL: llega a donde necesites gracias a sus 6 metros de radio de acci\u00f3n.&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Composici\u00f3n<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>Aspirador vertical&nbsp;<\/li><li>Accesorio para esquinas<\/li><li>Accesorio para muebles<\/li><li>Soporte de pared<\/li><li>Manual de instrucciones<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"CECOTEC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":46.18,"unit_price_tax":46.18,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza de Hogar","sub_category":"Aspiradores","quantity":0,"brand":"CECOTEC","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_cec-pae-asp%20popst%20600%20vit_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":41.18}}},"8435484083805":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435484083805",false],"wholesale_price":[41.18,false],"price":[46.18,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 3",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:95048","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 2","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/af8a1b8e46065490a4c38ebdbc532a0f.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Aspirador de Mano con bater\u00eda Cecotec Conga Rockstar Micro Essential 90W","category":"Limpieza de Hogar","sub_category":"Aspiradores","unit_price":46.18,"reference":"08380","ean13":"8435484083805","weight":"3","quantity":2,"brand":"CECOTEC","description_pt":"                                                <h2>Aspirador de mano ultraligero\u00a0Conga Rockstar Micro Essential<\/h2><div><p><ul><li>Motor Digital Brushless<\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>Potencia que puede con todo<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>Dise\u00f1o ultraligero<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>Dos modos de funcionamiento<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>Tecnolog\u00eda cicl\u00f3nica<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>Hasta 40&#180;de autonom\u00eda<\/span><\/li><li><span style='background-color: initial;'>Filtrado de alta eficiencia<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Descripci\u00f3n<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>Aspirador de mano con motor Digital Brushless de \u00faltima generaci\u00f3n sin escobillas, que proporciona mayor velocidad, un menor ruido y alarga la vida \u00fatil del aspirador. Adem\u00e1s, garantiza la m\u00e1xima eficiencia con el sistema Multiphasic System.<\/li><li>Tecnolog\u00eda ForceSonic con una potencia m\u00e1xima de 90 W. Aspira todo tipo de suciedad y mantiene tu hogar siempre limpio maximizando sus 13 kPa de poder de succi\u00f3n.<\/li><li>Dise\u00f1o ergon\u00f3mico y peso reducido para un uso c\u00f3modo y sencillo.<\/li><li>Dos modos de funcionamiento, Eco y Turbo, para adaptar su uso a cada circunstancia. El modo Eco alarga la bater\u00eda al m\u00e1ximo con resultados impecables y el modo Turbo acaba con la suciedad m\u00e1s dif\u00edcil.<\/li><li>M\u00e1xima eficiencia a lo largo de toda su vida \u00fatil gracias a la tecnolog\u00eda Cyclonic System. Incorpora los \u00faltimos avances en aspiraci\u00f3n para separar las part\u00edculas por fuerza centr\u00edfuga.<\/li><li>Sistema Battery 12,6 V con una bater\u00eda extra\u00edble de Ion-Litio de 2200 mAh y 12,6 V que consigue una autonom\u00eda de hasta 40 minutos.*<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Composici\u00f3n<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>Accesorio 2 en 1 para esquinas y muebles<\/li><li>Accesorio de tapicer\u00edas<\/li><li>Adaptador de corriente<\/li><li>Base de autocargado<\/li><\/ul>